[center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ngodn/CustomShellSystem/main/CCS/docs/media/v1.0.0-alpha.1/ccs-clip-4.gif[/img][/center]

[youtube]RsDMhNOcJIk[/youtube]

I built Custom Combat System to let you choose the animation each attack of your weapon plays. Put an enemy's swing on your light chain, a heavy from another weapon on your finisher, a boss move on your charged attack, then save the set as a preset and share the file. For each slot you choose how far it goes: keep your weapon's timing and hit numbers with only the animation changed, or take the move's own timing, its damage multiplier and poise damage, and even its weapon in your hand for the swing. Base damage and Resolve are always your weapon's. The move turns with your stick or your lock-on, and the game's hyper armor can cover it, so a fifteen second enemy combo plays like an attack of your own instead of a cutscene you are stuck in.

[size=4][i][b][color=#ff7700]This is an alpha and I am releasing it now to gather feedback, ideas and bug reports before the first full version.[/color][/b][/i][/size]

[size=4][b]What you can do[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Thirteen slots: light L1 L2 L3, light finisher LF, charged light LC, the same five for heavy, and the sprint attacks S+L and S+H.[/*]
[*]Candidates for every slot: all player weapons' moves, the enemy attacks that use the player's skeleton (so they play on your body), and any new attack animation the running game lists after a patch.[/*]
[*]Six settings per slot on the right panel. Speed, 0.5x to 4x. Feel: the game's timing or the move's own. Damage: the move's hit numbers or your weapon's. Visual: keep your weapon in hand or show the move's own weapon for the swing; on a punch or a kick it hides yours. Armor: the move's own hyper armor, or the game's hyper armor over the whole move. Steer: the stick turns you through the whole move and cancels the recovery after the last hit, or only the turn windows the move brings.[/*]
[*]Armor and Steer are on by default. Both bend the game's rules, so the Armor value is marked as a cheat. Set either to Move's own for the game's own behaviour.[/*]
[*]Presets: save, load and delete your sets. They are plain JSON files you can share.[/*]
[*]Search and filter the candidate list by typing.[/*]
[*]A master switch that puts every attack back to the weapon's own animation at once.[/*]
[*]Combos chain the way the game's do: a press during a swapped move is kept and the next step follows the hit. The Settings tab decides whether that is the first hit or the last one of a long move.[/*]
[/list]

